{"product_id":"summer-showers-cupcake-cousins-2","title":"Summer Showers (Cupcake Cousins, 2)","description":"\u003cp\u003eJoin the Cupcake Cousins as they solve a sticky mystery in this super sweet series about family and friendship!It's summertime, and the Bumpus family is growing! Aunt Rosie and Uncle Jonathan are expecting, and the entire family gathers together at Whispering Pines for a baby shower. But with Willow's injured hand and big sisters pushing their way into the kitchen, it looks like Delia and Willow might have to surrender their aprons. When Grandma gives each of the grandchildren a family heirloom, suddenly Delia's goes missing. Could it be lost in the cupcake's batter?Follow the tasty recipes once again as Delia and Willow solve the mystery of the missing keepsake and celebrate the arrival of even more cousins in the second book in this charming series.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 194\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kate Hannigan\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781484716625\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 240\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45696225837209,"sku":"2RA9781484716625","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68b860c2ebf05_Summer_Showers__Cupcake_Cousins__2__Kate_Hannigan.jpg?v=1756998367","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/summer-showers-cupcake-cousins-2","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}